comment = "Protocol Buffers compiler and private C++ runtime"

desc = <<EOD
/usr/libexec/protoc (protoc(1)), the Protocol Buffers compiler, with its
C++ generator and the upb C code generator plugins (not on the default
PATH; ports keep their own protoc), and the private libraries it uses: the
protobuf C++ runtime (libprivateprotobuf, libprivateprotobuf-lite) and
Abseil (libprivateabsl).  The libraries are for base system programs; code
built outside the base system should use the ports Protocol Buffers.
EOD
